1)b. Write a HTML program, to explain the working of hyperlinks using <a> tag and href, target
Attributes.
<!DOCTYPE html>
<head>
<title>Hyperlink Example</title>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Hyperlink Demo</h1>
<!-- Link that opens in a new tab -->
<p>
Visit <a href="https://www.google.com" target="_blank">Google</a>.
</p>
<!-- Link to a section on the same page -->
<p>
Go to the <a href="https://www.github.com">Next Section</a>.
</p>
<!-- Section within the same page -->
<h2 id="section1">Next Section</h2>
<p>You've reached the next section!</p>
</body>
</html>
